  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "my oven fan keeps going after ive turned the oven off, been about 20 mins now. is it broken??"
  },
  {
   "role": "assistant",
   "text": "Probably not broken. Many ovens run a separate cooling fan after switch-off to protect the controls and surrounding cupboard; 10–30 minutes is quite normal, especially after a hot or long cook. Leave it alone for now and check whether it stops once the oven is fully cool. If it keeps running for hours or is still running when everything is cold, that points to the cooling-fan control/thermostat and would need an engineer."
  }
